                                        "entry_id": "135faef1-a609-317a-85f5-1dc20404a923",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who fits a lining to something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a8d64f4-eaa2-4423-b1cc-8b66e7f93f69",
                                                "sense_id": "e8996e21-efea-3eba-bbc9-9cab81e7dcd1",
                                                "text": "a liner of shoes"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "168b437e-1541-44d9-91df-08f9345fa9ff",
                                                "sense_id": "e8996e21-efea-3eba-bbc9-9cab81e7dcd1",
                                                "text": "A good liner has a pretty shrewd idea of the value of the painting he is treating and usually charges accordingly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0fd53941-9f12-3687-9f48-67f93144ef66",
                                        "entry_id": "135faef1-a609-317a-85f5-1dc20404a923",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A removable cover or lining."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a6279bf-580b-4922-a9a8-fd3acd2264f9",
                                                "sense_id": "0fd53941-9f12-3687-9f48-67f93144ef66",
                                                "text": "I threw out the trash can liner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "471360c9-e026-4f29-a721-42c9b7bdb738",
                                                "sense_id": "0fd53941-9f12-3687-9f48-67f93144ef66",
                                                "text": "Lane Coutell, in a Burberry raincoat that apparently had a wool liner buttoned into it, was one of the six or seven boys out on the open platform."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "586cb97c-fa38-34fc-b721-b34d36698699",
                                        "entry_id": "135faef1-a609-317a-85f5-1dc20404a923",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The pamphlet supplied in the box with an audiovisual tape or disc, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f42e71e-58ff-40d6-8873-13402841e261",
                                                "sense_id": "586cb97c-fa38-34fc-b721-b34d36698699",
                                                "text": "liner notes"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0565e6d8-099d-3b74-ba05-f337da690541",
                                        "entry_id": "135faef1-a609-317a-85f5-1dc20404a923",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lining within the cylinder of a steam engine, in which the piston works and between which and the outer shell of the cylinder a space is left to form a steam jacket."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0df1b8a7-4ea3-3bac-be1f-5982d95484c2",
                                        "entry_id": "135faef1-a609-317a-85f5-1dc20404a923",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A similar lining for cylinders of internal-combustion engines (see \\\"Further reading\\\")."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f2fe049-6029-3cc4-b565-3dd5945c0265",
                                        "entry_id": "135faef1-a609-317a-85f5-1dc20404a923",
